# The words of the language, as the workshop shows them (written in GRML: a word added here is in the workshop).
# family NAME icon SIGN "words" fr "mots"
# word WORD family NAME level 1|2|3 icon SIGN example "a line" "what it does" fr "ce qu'il fait"
family there icon box "What there is" fr "Ce qui existe"
family links icon link "What links them" fr "Ce qui les lie"
family known icon eye "What is known" fr "Ce qu'on sait"
family time icon timer "Time" fr "Le temps"
family constants icon pi "The constants" fr "Les constantes"
family more icon blocks "More" fr "Plus loin"

word node family there level 1 icon circle-dot example "node mass = 70" "a quantity: a mass, a length, a price, a pitch... (signed: it can be negative)" fr "une quantité : une masse, une longueur, un prix, une hauteur de note… (signed : elle peut être négative)"
word input family there level 2 icon log-in example "input pitch = 220 positive" "a quantity that comes from outside: a slider, a sensor, a table" fr "une quantité qui vient de dehors : un curseur, un capteur, un tableau"
word output family there level 2 icon log-out example "output force" "what is read, shown or heard" fr "ce qu'on lit, montre ou entend"
word learn family there level 3 icon brain example "learn k = 1" "a weight the machine learns from what it sees" fr "un poids que la machine apprend de ce qu'elle voit"
word memory family there level 3 icon archive example "memory last = 0" "a quantity that keeps what it was given" fr "une quantité qui garde ce qu'on lui a donné"
word rail family there level 3 icon fence example "rail mass 1000" "a quantity kept within a factor of where it is (it never goes to infinity)" fr "une quantité tenue à un facteur près de là où elle est (elle ne part jamais à l'infini)"

word relate family links level 1 icon spline example "relate newton: force = mass * acceleration" "an equation between quantities: a law, a definition, a rule (+ - * / ^, ln, exp, sqrt, the constants)" fr "une équation entre des quantités : une loi, une définition, une règle (+ - * / ^, ln, exp, sqrt, les constantes)"
word keep family links level 2 icon fence example "keep floor: height >= 0" "a limit: a quantity kept at least, or at most, at a value" fr "une limite : une quantité gardée au moins, ou au plus, à une valeur"
word fuse family links level 3 icon merge example "fuse weight mass" "two names of the same quantity made one" fr "deux noms d'une même quantité réunis en un"

word observe family known level 1 icon gauge example "observe mass = 70" "a measurement: what was seen of a quantity (± how sure)" fr "une mesure : ce qu'on a vu d'une quantité (± avec quelle certitude)"
word ask family known level 1 icon circle-help example "ask force" "a question: what a quantity is worth, how sure, and why" fr "une question : ce que vaut une quantité, avec quelle certitude, et pourquoi"
word forget family known level 2 icon eraser example "forget mass" "a measurement taken back: the quantity is free again" fr "une mesure retirée : la quantité redevient libre"

word var family time level 3 icon variable example "var position = 0" "a state that changes at each step (what set writes)" fr "un état qui change à chaque pas (ce que set écrit)"
word set family time level 3 icon step-forward example "set position = position + speed" "at each step, what a state becomes" fr "à chaque pas, ce que devient un état"
word carry family time level 3 icon arrow-right-left example "carry x = y" "from step to step, a quantity carried with how sure it is" fr "d'un pas à l'autre, une quantité portée avec sa certitude"
word delay family time level 3 icon history example "delay echo = voice by 0.25" "what a quantity was a while ago (seconds)" fr "ce que valait une quantité il y a un moment (en secondes)"
word play family time level 2 icon play example "play lead_s" "a quantity heard, 48 000 times a second" fr "une quantité qu'on entend, 48 000 fois par seconde"

word pi family constants level 1 icon pi example "relate circle: perimeter = 2 * pi * radius" "pi, 3.14159...: half a turn (tau is a whole one)" fr "pi, 3,14159… : un demi-tour (tau en est un entier)"
word tau family constants level 1 icon rotate-cw example "node turn = tau / 4" "tau, 6.28318...: a whole turn, 2 pi" fr "tau, 6,28318… : un tour entier, 2 pi"
word e family constants level 2 icon trending-up example "relate growth: amount = e * start" "e, 2.71828...: what grows by itself" fr "e, 2,71828… : ce qui croît de lui-même"
word phi family constants level 2 icon shell example "node gold = phi" "phi, 1.61803...: the golden ratio" fr "phi, 1,61803… : le nombre d'or"
word sqrt2 family constants level 3 icon square example "relate diagonal: d = sqrt2 * side" "the square root of 2: a square's diagonal" fr "la racine de 2 : la diagonale d'un carré"
word c0 family constants level 3 icon zap example "relate light: distance = c0 * seconds" "the speed of light, 299 792 458 m/s" fr "la vitesse de la lumière, 299 792 458 m/s"

word repeat family more level 3 icon repeat example "repeat k in 1 .. 4: node mass_{k} = 1" "a line said for each k" fr "une ligne dite pour chaque k"
word network family more level 3 icon network example "network spring(k): ... end" "a network of one's own, to call as often as wished (its lines, then end)" fr "un réseau à soi, à appeler autant de fois qu'on veut (ses lignes, puis end)"
word call family more level 3 icon phone-outgoing example "call spring(k=a)" "a network of one's own, called" fr "un réseau à soi, appelé"
